 *   Line 1: Corporate & Strategy (Cobalt)
 *   Line 2: Business Ventures (Rose)
 *   Line 3: AI Tools (Amber)
 *   Line 4: Data (Green)
 *   Line 5: Passion Projects (Purple)
 *
 * Dynamic Cross-Line Connections:
 * Hovering or clicking any station draws smooth SVG transit connectors
 * across lines. Hovering over a connection line reveals the relationship
 * and allows reading more about both sides of the work.
